Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cineva să mă ajute...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă doare foarte tare...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă simt de parcă...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,mai există cineva \Nînăuntrul meu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi spune în continuu că \Nvrea să iasă la suprafață.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simt că mă sufoc!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un tip ca mine venit din \Nstrăfundul zonei nordice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu are cum să facă față \Nla o asemenea căldură!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Parcă pe aici trebuia să fie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu sunt Takamura Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}My mom's in the hospital\Nfor an extended stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deci am venit în Tokyo ca \Nsă locuiesc la niște rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}De necrezut, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar cred că sunt puțin \Nîncântat de situație.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că nu e nimeni acasă.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate ar fi trebuit să sun \Ncând am coborât în stație.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să vedem...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, fir-ar să fie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-O-Oh, ei bine... \NVai, e așa de cald afară!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, așteaptă! \NNu sunt un pervers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă! Mamă! Un pervers \Na intrat peste noi în curte!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheamă poliția!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Takamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș fi venit după tine la \Nstație dacă ne-ai fi sunat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,I'm sorry, I've been\Nareal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,Well, it sounds like you've\Ngot your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum se mai simte mama ta?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operația a decurs fără probleme, \Ndeci începe să se simtă mai bine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami s-a dus în camera ei \Nfără ca măcar să-și ceară scuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't mind her being quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's a poor talker,\Nand timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my fault for letting\Nmyself into the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, | explained to you that\NTooru would be coming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry | was so rude to\Nyou earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You couldn't help mistake\Nme for a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's partly my fault, too, for\Nletting myself into the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, I'm going to make\Ndinner, so help me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:13.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, | was blown away to see\Nwhat a babe Manami'd become.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze you between these!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't like your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My last uniform had\Na standup collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this one's kind of drafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, college uniforms in\NTokyo sure have short skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Summer time; a short skirt\Nblows in the breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Manami chick has come\Nto college with a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, he's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what's Manami doing\Nstuck to him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't like the looks of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things would've gone\Nso well with Masaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if it hadn't been for Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was Chiaki jilted because\Nof Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably because Manami\Nput on a real cutesy act.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which isn't to say that\Nyou're not cute, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami's not just cute,\Nshe's got a great figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we got changed in gym\Nshe had quite the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheeky broad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's how she\Nseduced Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| can't takeit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Chiaki...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cute or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're wrong if you think\NI'll let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to teach you a lesson;\Nthat's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Right!\N-Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women are such loose-lipped\Nbeavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're mixing your\Nmetaphors, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's your first day here going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a typical city college with\Nlots of cute babes, so it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd run into\Nyou at lunch, Manami...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and here, you were eating\Nwith this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's gone out of her\Nway to hang out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out, or you'll make\NMasaya jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's my relative's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Masaya an excuse, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, so is Masaya your\Nboyfriend, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's really not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really in a position\Nto be making any judgments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Physical Education\NSo, women have their\Nperiods every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm not talking about\Npunctuation, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm on to you, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've spent the whole day\Nwith a new transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make me jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not what it sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better hurry to our club\Nor we'll be crushed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for me in the cafeteria\Ntill my club's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geez, sure is tough transferring\Npart way through college!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what | didn't need...\Na cat fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, didn't you know Chiaki\Nwas going out with Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You went and seduced him,\Nand they'd been getting along!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way..!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, just because you're\Nnot bad looking...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then today, a transfer\Nstudent's after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's just my...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're we wrong about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about explaining yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. This is trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Leave her alone!\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a lame ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better rescue yourself first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aha! He's that transfer student!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You slag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how you trapped Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't trap him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the one who started\Ntalking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you weren't around, I'd\Nbe with him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it with Masaya here,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't need those when\Nyou meet with him today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold her arms, Tomoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,NOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look at those cute pubes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll do something nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No..!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like my head's\Nsplitting in two again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm being too\Neasy on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in paying back your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the same, quiet Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit gawking and help\Nme out, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you..!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smash!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeabh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No way..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you gawking at,\Nbonehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Manami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that dumb name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just call me Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, that was quite the\Ngrueling first day, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's your mom\Nand dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad's golfing, and mom's\Nat her culture class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoah! Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was an incredible\Nday, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:27.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... um... Tooru?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did | do anything strange\Nyesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't you remember\Nwhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| vaguely remember Chiaki\Nand the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,calling me outside yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But | can't even remember\Nhow | got home after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tease me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:16:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you totally outmaneuvered\NChiaki and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You took their panties and\Nput them on their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way | can believe\Nthat you can't remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really, really can't remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something... something must\Nbe wrong with my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry\Nabout it, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're so pretty\Nand strong, and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It really knocked me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Nami"...? You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what you\Ntold me to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, if you can't remember\Nall that wild stuff you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's like a split\Npersonality!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Manami's other\Npersonality; Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gentle beauty, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| realized that hidden inside,\Nshe had a split personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The diametrically opposed\Npersonality, called Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But neither her mom or dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not to mention Manami\Nherself knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes she merely suffers\Nfrom memory loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that alone seems to\Nhave really shocked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way | can tell\Nher the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only | know this Nami person?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not amusing!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami and Nami\NSprite
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'll | do? My bra and\Npanties are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't seem very chipper,\NManami, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just that we have\Nswimming in gym tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, can't you swim or\Nsomething?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| can so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotta wear a swim\Nsuit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not many people go into\Nthe pool in their uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what | meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean you're shy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have anything\Nto feel shy about, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got a great body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this were Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she'd have way more fun\Nin the pool than in a class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come off it, Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just that I'm a pretty\Ngood swimmer myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She scared me, her eyes\Nlook just like Nami's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, they're one and\Nthe same person, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The shy Manami, and the\Noutgoing Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're both actually Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd be the ideal woman if she\Nwere a perfect blend of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or else if she could choose her\Npersonality anytime she wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeabh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then she wouldn't have any\Nproblems in the pool, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it when | called her Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-N-No way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seeing her like that,\NSakumoto's pretty hot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's got a childlike face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But her hooters are\Nsurprisingly big!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she's got a tiny waist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky, living with\Na cute babe like her, Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not all fun and\Ngames, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lame brain! You're\Nreally pissing me of f!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:54.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see your butt hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys are such\Nloudmouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'll | do? My bra and\Npanties are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:20.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And | just took my gym\Nclothes home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope | make it through last\Nclass without anyone noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Sakumoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.01,0:23:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.15,0:23:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your chest seems a bit chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Going bra-less, even\Nwith those big tits?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like feeling liberated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did she take my bra\Nand panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got something\Nto say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.70,0:23:57.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Miss Lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.77,0:24:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're liberated under\Nthat skirt of yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.28,0:24:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you couldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.75,0:24:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, | sure wish | could've\Ngone swimming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've got my period,\Nso | was out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll give her\Nareal taste of revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.73,0:24:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.03,0:24:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's this happening\Nto me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| wish | could just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.01,0:25:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you upset about what\Nhappened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.75,0:25:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, do exactly as | say!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lift up Manami's skirt\Nin front of everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.09,0:25:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll throw out\Nthese panties you stole!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:26:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Give them back!\N-See...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.56,0:26:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do as | say, I'll\Ngive these back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'll also give you\Nmy panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.04,0:26:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Okay?\N-l don't want yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.11,0:26:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want everyone\Nto know you're the panty thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.82,0:26:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then do it and don't\Ngive me any lip!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.89,0:26:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.29,0:26:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.76,0:26:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Sakumoto, in the\Nnext class.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's going bra-less and\Npanty-less today"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.63,0:26:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.50,0:26:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With her body?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.90,0:26:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit being ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.54,0:26:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Chiaki told everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.94,0:26:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki did?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Takamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.31,0:26:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Class is gonna start!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.18,0:26:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm skipping out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.85,0:27:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Figures. He's gotta get\Na peek for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.53,0:27:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.76,0:27:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki skipped swimming\Nclass...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to get even for\Nthe other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.17,0:27:18.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Manami can't stop\NChiaki by herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.17,0:27:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and | show up all\Nnonchalant...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing\N|cando..!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.25,0:28:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That triangle... that square...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.15,0:28:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Square means tofu...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.79,0:28:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tofu is white...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White means panties...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If everyone finds out\Nyou're the panty thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:30.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be kicked out\Nof college!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kicked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.26,0:29:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ntrying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,owwwwm
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.73,0:29:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your class is over there!!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit whispering in the\Nshadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.25,0:29:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wanna check, like him,\Nthen get over here and check!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cool...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.02,0:29:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.99,0:29:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she can stand up\Nthere and say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.89,0:29:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thenit's gotta be a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.70,0:29:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| won't let anyone say such\Nbad things about Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:30:01.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure had a different\Nopinion of her a minute ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I honestly didn't go because\NI had my period!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru, pin her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.76,0:30:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What're you doing, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does look like you've\Ngot your period.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:35.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you've gotta believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| just happened to see old Flatfish\Nstealing your underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.78,0:30:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then tell me just how these\Ngot into your bag, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.52,0:30:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made him give them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.95,0:30:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then explain why you didn't\Nsay anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.86,0:30:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.49,0:31:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| couldn't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He threatened to steal mine\Nunless | kept quiet about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.57,0:31:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.67,0:31:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.34,0:31:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that feels better!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, how about cutting\Nback on the violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.78,0:31:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get Manami in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you should've called\Nme out sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:30.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but | didn't think things\Nwould turn out that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They did because you skipped\Nclass today and came to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, | guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.80,0:31:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, mom and dad aren't\Nhome yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, how do | get\NNami to turn back into Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.91,0:31:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| usually just turn back\Nby the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.95,0:31:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.51,0:31:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking of being\Nnaughty with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while I'm Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.05,0:32:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.19,0:32:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just honestly worried,\Nthat's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.66,0:32:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geez, all | did was ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.99,0:32:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami wouldn't do it\Neven if you asked her!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.60,0:32:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get Manami in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just my way\Nof saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.17,0:32:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi micuțul nostru secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.76,0:32:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-D-De ce nu ai chiloți pe tine?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.79,0:32:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki ți i-a dat înapoi, nu?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.93,0:32:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, dar mă simt \Nmult mai liberă așa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Manami returned\Nto her self...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.71,0:32:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she couldn't remember this,\Nluckily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.34,0:32:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Nami...!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit acting, when you're\Nobviously thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.68,0:33:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, isn't this what you\Nalways do with Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that, Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.79,0:33:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.99,0:33:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.96,0:33:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:33:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come out! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with all the groping?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.18,0:34:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You couldn't handle dealing\Nwith Manami, so you called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.05,0:34:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hate to disappoint you, but\Nyou're not getting your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I'm pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.82,0:34:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.63,0:34:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce ești și tu supărată?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.16,0:34:21.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.10,0:34:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show some remorse!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.73,0:34:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You double-crosser!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă... Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Imai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.81,0:34:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Takamura Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.11,0:34:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Know where Manami is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.18,0:34:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă nu s-a întors...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, she did come back\Nfor a bit, but she's out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.25,0:34:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.72,0:34:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you\Nhear from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.25,0:34:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde s-ar fi putut duce Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.75,0:35:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?\Nyou're soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.89,0:35:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.70,0:35:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm disappearing...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.14,0:35:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:35.30,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Spiritul \NManami și Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.54,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(757,368)\blur0.8\c&H747573&}Sakumoto
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:09.84,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Spiritul \NManami și Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.40,0:35:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:55.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:35:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.40,0:36:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.40,0:36:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels just as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,somebody’s inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me out, it's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:35.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami and Nami\NSprite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's sweltering!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A guy like me from the\Nboondocks in the north...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can't put up with this heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thereit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name's Takamura Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom's in the hospital\Nfor an extended stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so | ended up coming to\Nstay with relatives in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unreal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But | think | might even\Nbe a bit excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe | should've called\Nfrom the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Gee whiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um..er...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boy, it sure is hot out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! I'm not\Na pervert or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!\NThere's a weirdo here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Tooru Taka...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Tooru....!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| would've picked you up\Nat the station if you'd called.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I've been\Nareal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it sounds like you've\Ngot your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mom's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she had her operation,\Nso she's feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami went upstairs\Nwithout even apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't mind her being quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's a poor talker,\Nand timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my fault for letting\Nmyself into the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, | explained to you that\NTooru would be coming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry | was so rude to\Nyou earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You couldn't help mistake\Nme for a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's partly my fault, too, for\Nletting myself into the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, I'm going to make\Ndinner, so help me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:13.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, | was blown away to see\Nwhat a babe Manami'd become.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze you between these!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't like your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My last uniform had\Na standup collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this one's kind of drafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, college uniforms in\NTokyo sure have short skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Summer time; a short skirt\Nblows in the breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Manami chick has come\Nto college with a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, he's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what's Manami doing\Nstuck to him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't like the looks of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things would've gone\Nso well with Masaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if it hadn't been for Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was Chiaki jilted because\Nof Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably because Manami\Nput on a real cutesy act.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which isn't to say that\Nyou're not cute, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami's not just cute,\Nshe's got a great figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we got changed in gym\Nshe had quite the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheeky broad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's how she\Nseduced Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| can't takeit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Chiaki...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cute or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're wrong if you think\NI'll let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to teach you a lesson;\Nthat's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Right!\N-Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women are such loose-lipped\Nbeavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're mixing your\Nmetaphors, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's your first day here going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a typical city college with\Nlots of cute babes, so it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd run into\Nyou at lunch, Manami...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and here, you were eating\Nwith this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's gone out of her\Nway to hang out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out, or you'll make\NMasaya jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's my relative's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Masaya an excuse, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, so is Masaya your\Nboyfriend, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's really not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really in a position\Nto be making any judgments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Physical Education\NSo, women have their\Nperiods every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm not talking about\Npunctuation, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm on to you, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've spent the whole day\Nwith a new transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make me jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not what it sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better hurry to our club\Nor we'll be crushed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for me in the cafeteria\Ntill my club's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geez, sure is tough transferring\Npart way through college!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what | didn't need...\Na cat fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami, didn't you know Chiaki\Nwas going out with Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You went and seduced him,\Nand they'd been getting along!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way..!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, just because you're\Nnot bad looking...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then today, a transfer\Nstudent's after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's just my...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're we wrong about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about explaining yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. This is trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Leave her alone!\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a lame ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better rescue yourself first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aha! He's that transfer student!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You slag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how you trapped Masaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't trap him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the one who started\Ntalking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you weren't around, I'd\Nbe with him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it with Masaya here,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't need those when\Nyou meet with him today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold her arms, Tomoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,NOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look at those cute pubes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll do something nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No..!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like my head's\Nsplitting in two again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm being too\Neasy on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in paying back your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the same, quiet Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit gawking and help\Nme out, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you..!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smash!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeabh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No way..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you gawking at,\Nbonehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Manami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that dumb name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just call me Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, that was quite the\Ngrueling first day, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's your mom\Nand dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad's golfing, and mom's\Nat her culture class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoah! Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was an incredible\Nday, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:27.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... um... Tooru?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did | do anything strange\Nyesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't you remember\Nwhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| vaguely remember Chiaki\Nand the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,calling me outside yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But | can't even remember\Nhow | got home after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tease me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:16:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you totally outmaneuvered\NChiaki and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You took their panties and\Nput them on their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way | can believe\Nthat you can't remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really, really can't remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something... something must\Nbe wrong with my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry\Nabout it, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're so pretty\Nand strong, and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It really knocked me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Nami"...? You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what you\Ntold me to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, if you can't remember\Nall that wild stuff you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's like a split\Npersonality!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Manami's other\Npersonality; Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gentle beauty, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| realized that hidden inside,\Nshe had a split personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The diametrically opposed\Npersonality, called Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But neither her mom or dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not to mention Manami\Nherself knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes she merely suffers\Nfrom memory loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that alone seems to\Nhave really shocked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way | can tell\Nher the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only | know this Nami person?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not amusing!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami and Nami\NSprite
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'll | do? My bra and\Npanties are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't seem very chipper,\NManami, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just that we have\Nswimming in gym tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, can't you swim or\Nsomething?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| can so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotta wear a swim\Nsuit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not many people go into\Nthe pool in their uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what | meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean you're shy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have anything\Nto feel shy about, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got a great body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this were Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she'd have way more fun\Nin the pool than in a class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come off it, Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just that I'm a pretty\Ngood swimmer myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She scared me, her eyes\Nlook just like Nami's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, they're one and\Nthe same person, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The shy Manami, and the\Noutgoing Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're both actually Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd be the ideal woman if she\Nwere a perfect blend of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or else if she could choose her\Npersonality anytime she wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeabh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then she wouldn't have any\Nproblems in the pool, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it when | called her Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-N-No way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seeing her like that,\NSakumoto's pretty hot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's got a childlike face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But her hooters are\Nsurprisingly big!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she's got a tiny waist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky, living with\Na cute babe like her, Tooru!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not all fun and\Ngames, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lame brain! You're\Nreally pissing me of f!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:54.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see your butt hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys are such\Nloudmouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'll | do? My bra and\Npanties are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:20.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And | just took my gym\Nclothes home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope | make it through last\Nclass without anyone noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Sakumoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.01,0:23:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.15,0:23:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your chest seems a bit chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Going bra-less, even\Nwith those big tits?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like feeling liberated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did she take my bra\Nand panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got something\Nto say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.70,0:23:57.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Miss Lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.77,0:24:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're liberated under\Nthat skirt of yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.28,0:24:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you couldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.75,0:24:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, | sure wish | could've\Ngone swimming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've got my period,\Nso | was out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll give her\Nareal taste of revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.73,0:24:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.03,0:24:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's this happening\Nto me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| wish | could just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.01,0:25:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you upset about what\Nhappened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.75,0:25:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, do exactly as | say!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lift up Manami's skirt\Nin front of everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.09,0:25:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll throw out\Nthese panties you stole!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:26:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Give them back!\N-See...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.56,0:26:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do as | say, I'll\Ngive these back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'll also give you\Nmy panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.04,0:26:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-Okay?\N-l don't want yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.11,0:26:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want everyone\Nto know you're the panty thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.82,0:26:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then do it and don't\Ngive me any lip!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.89,0:26:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.29,0:26:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.76,0:26:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Sakumoto, in the\Nnext class.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's going bra-less and\Npanty-less today"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.63,0:26:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.50,0:26:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With her body?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.90,0:26:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit being ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.54,0:26:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Chiaki told everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.94,0:26:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki did?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Takamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.31,0:26:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Class is gonna start!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.18,0:26:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm skipping out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.85,0:27:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Figures. He's gotta get\Na peek for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.53,0:27:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.76,0:27:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki skipped swimming\Nclass...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to get even for\Nthe other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.17,0:27:18.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Manami can't stop\NChiaki by herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.17,0:27:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and | show up all\Nnonchalant...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing\N|cando..!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.25,0:28:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That triangle... that square...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.15,0:28:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Square means tofu...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.79,0:28:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tofu is white...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White means panties...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If everyone finds out\Nyou're the panty thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:30.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be kicked out\Nof college!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kicked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.26,0:29:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ntrying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,owwwwm
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.73,0:29:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your class is over there!!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit whispering in the\Nshadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.25,0:29:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wanna check, like him,\Nthen get over here and check!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cool...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.02,0:29:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.99,0:29:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she can stand up\Nthere and say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.89,0:29:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thenit's gotta be a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.70,0:29:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| won't let anyone say such\Nbad things about Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:30:01.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure had a different\Nopinion of her a minute ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I honestly didn't go because\NI had my period!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru, pin her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.76,0:30:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What're you doing, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does look like you've\Ngot your period.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:35.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you've gotta believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| just happened to see old Flatfish\Nstealing your underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.78,0:30:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then tell me just how these\Ngot into your bag, Chiaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.52,0:30:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made him give them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.95,0:30:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then explain why you didn't\Nsay anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.86,0:30:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.49,0:31:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| couldn't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He threatened to steal mine\Nunless | kept quiet about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.57,0:31:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.67,0:31:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.34,0:31:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that feels better!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, how about cutting\Nback on the violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.78,0:31:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get Manami in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you should've called\Nme out sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:30.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but | didn't think things\Nwould turn out that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They did because you skipped\Nclass today and came to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, | guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.80,0:31:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, mom and dad aren't\Nhome yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, how do | get\NNami to turn back into Manami?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.91,0:31:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,| usually just turn back\Nby the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.95,0:31:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.51,0:31:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking of being\Nnaughty with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while I'm Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.05,0:32:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.19,0:32:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just honestly worried,\Nthat's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.66,0:32:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geez, all | did was ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.99,0:32:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami wouldn't do it\Neven if you asked her!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.60,0:32:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get Manami in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just my way\Nof saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.17,0:32:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-secret...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.76,0:32:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What are you doing\Nwith a bare butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.79,0:32:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiaki gave them back,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.93,0:32:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but this way feels\Nalot freer!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Manami returned\Nto her self...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.71,0:32:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she couldn't remember this,\Nluckily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.34,0:32:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Nami...!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit acting, when you're\Nobviously thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.36,0:33:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manami and Nami\NSprite
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.68,0:33:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, isn't this what you\Nalways do with Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that, Manami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.79,0:33:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.99,0:33:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.96,0:33:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:33:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come out! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with all the groping?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.18,0:34:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You couldn't handle dealing\Nwith Manami, so you called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.05,0:34:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hate to disappoint you, but\Nyou're not getting your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I'm pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.82,0:34:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.63,0:34:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come you're mad, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.16,0:34:21.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.10,0:34:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show some remorse!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.73,0:34:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You double-crosser!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait... Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Imai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.81,0:34:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Takamura Tooru.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.11,0:34:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Know where Manami is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.18,0:34:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not back yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, she did come back\Nfor a bit, but she's out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.25,0:34:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.72,0:34:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you\Nhear from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.25,0:34:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where could Nami have\Ngone to, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.75,0:35:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?\Nyou're soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.89,0:35:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.70,0:35:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm disappearing...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.14,0:35:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,NAMIM!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
